 via a covered link bridge, placing residents just four stops away from KLCC. The property offers excellent connectivity to major road networks, including the Ampang-Kuala Lumpur Elevated Highway (AKLEH), Middle Ring Road 2 (MRR2), and DUKE Highway. Located within the prestigious Embassy Row enclave, Datum Jelatek is surrounded by essential amenities. Residents enjoy the convenience of the integrated Datum Jelatek Shopping Centre right at their doorstep. Nearby, the Great Eastern Mall is just 900m away, with Intermark Mall also in close proximity. Premier medical facilities such as Gleneagles Kuala Lumpur are located just over 1km away. Other nearby options include Klinik Menara and Klinik Veda. A host of educational institutions are nearby, including Sayfol International School (1.8km), SMK Seri Ampang (2km), and Geomatica University College (2km). Datum Jelatek is a flagship project by DatumCorp International Sdn Bhd, the property development arm of the Selangor State Development Corporation (PKNS), a major and reputable developer in Malaysia with a vast portfolio of successful projects.\n\nRead more\n\nProject details\n\nType Service Residence\n\nPrice RM 689K - 840K\n\nCompletion year 2022\n\nTenure Leasehold\n\nNo. of blocks 1\n\nTotal units 712\n\n\n##### Frequently Asked Questions\n\n##### How many properties are there for sale?\n\nThere are 4 properties for sale.\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nDatum Jelatek Residence untuk Untuk Dijual - RM 394,200, Ogos 2026 (https://www.propertyguru.com.my/bm/senarai-hartanah/datum-jelatek-residence-untuk-dijual-oleh-chin-pey-ling-501694838)\nciteturn179search8 [wordlim: 200] Published: 2 months ago; Crawled: last month; ### Datum Jelatek Residence below market value auction unit for sale\n\n# Datum Jelatek Residence\n\nDatum Jelatek, Jln Jelatek, Jelatek, KL City Centre, Kuala Lumpur\n\n## RM 394,200\n\n* * *\n\nImage: BT\n\n1\n\nBT\n\nImage: BM\n\n1\n\nBM\n\nImage: k