acting both end-users and investors seeking a high quality of living. The living units are available in options ranging from one - to three-bedrooms. Datum Jelatek Residence will be part of a comprehensive master plan that incorporates retail shops, office space, and recreational areas to create a complete lifestyle destination.\n\nSituated in Kuala Lumpur City Centre, the development is easily accessible via major roads and public transportation. The development is also directly connected to the Jelatek LRT station via covered walkway, providing seamless access to the Greater Kuala Lumpur region.\n\n### Concept\n\nThe location of Datum Jelatek Residence is one of its main attractions as an investment. This development is only 10 minutes away from the Kuala Lumpur city centre, 5 minutes from Setiawangsa, and is next door to Ampang. The development is directly connected to the Jelatek LRT station via covered walkway, providing easy access to the Greater Kuala Lumpur via public transportation.\n\nThe mixed development includes a highly integrated street-level retail podium, providing residents with access to a fabulous array of shopping, dining, and entertainment within the project itself. Additional residential amenities include a sky pool and deck, a sky gym with city views, and lushly landscaped outdoor decks for lounging or recreation.\n\nSustainability and eco-friendliness are a main component of Datum Jelatek Residence with its integration of green building technologies and energy-efficient systems, which contribute to significant reductions in operating costs.\n\n"
